ss="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">14</span>Visual Art</div><p>Drawing, painting, sculpture, photography, installation.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">15</span>Music</div><p>Melody, harmony, rhythm, timbre aur form.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">16</span>Architecture</div><p>Space, structure, function, aesthetics aur urban context.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">17</span>Film</div><p>Image, sound, editing, narrative aur visual language.</p></div><h4>SELF-TEST</h4><ul><li>Is section ka sabse basic question kya hai?</li><li>Iske 3 concepts ko ek doosre se connect karke samjhao.</li><li>Is field mein kya established hai aur kya abhi uncertain/open hai?</li></ul><p>Knowledge Multiverse — Master Roadmap                                             Page 29</p></div>
