          <div class="card-head"><span class="section-no">23</span><h3>PSYCHOLOGY &amp; HUMAN BEHAVIOUR</h3><span class="chevron">⌄</span></div>
          <div class="card-body"><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">1</span>Behaviorism</div><p>Observable behaviour aur learning processes par emphasis.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">2</span>Cognitive Psychology</div><p>Attention, memory, language, reasoning aur problem solving.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">3</span>Developmental Psychology</div><p>Cognition, emotion aur behaviour across lifespan.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">4</span>Social Psychology</div><p>Groups, norms, persuasion, identity aur interpersonal behaviour.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">5</span>Personality</div><p>Traits, individual differences aur personality models.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">6</span>Learning</div><p>Classical conditioning, operant conditioning, observational learning.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">7</span>Memory Science</div><p>Encoding, consolidation, retrieval aur forgetting.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">8</span>Motivation</div><p>Goals, rewards, needs aur self-regulation.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">9</span>Decision Biases</div><p>Heuristics aur systematic judgment errors.</p></div><div class="topic"><div class="topic-name"><span class="topic-num">10</span>Mental Models</div><p>World ko samajhne ke internal conceptual frameworks.</p></div><h4>SELF-TEST</h4><ul><li>Is section ka sabse basic question kya hai?</li><li>Iske 3 concepts ko ek doosre se connect karke samjhao.</li><li>Is field mein kya established hai aur kya abhi uncertain/open hai?</li></ul><p>Knowledge Multiverse — Master Roadmap                                   Page 30</p></div>
